(text "HSO-5 CARD, card type 0x0012. 5 protected high-side outputs (TPS1HTC30-class,\nbaseline AUX1-AUX5 circuit); a 2nd instance replaces AUX6-AUX10.\nSelf-contained: own SN74LVC541A enable buffer (outputs only enabled while\nOUT_EN_N is low), own TMUX1208 current-sense mux to ANA_OUT, own BAT54C\nclamps, own MCP23S17.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-4 OUT1-5_REQ, GPA5 DIAG_EN, GPA6-7 SLOT_ID0/1; GPB0-4\nOUT1-5_RB_N, GPB5-7 MUX_A0-2. SLOT_ID2/IDP not read (no spare GPIO): slot\nidentity also comes from the I2C mux channel.\nBaseline names: OUTk = AUXk. Net changes: net_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 229.87 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1033a96c-b4bf-4cd7-a331-0ef01df363d2"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
